OL,3,GNEWSAFormer residents' sad farewell as
OL,4,Aflat demolition begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demolition of three blocks of flats
OL,7,Fin Coventry is a sad moment for former
OL,8,Fresidents who grew up there.
OL,10,FAs diggers move in to clear the flats
OL,11,Fat Ferrers Close in Tile Hill, Stacey
OL,12,FQueeney, who spent her formative years
OL,13,Fin the blue block, said she feels a
OL,14,Fdeep sadness watching the building
OL,15,Fdisappear.
OL,17,FShe lived there from birth until the
OL,18,Fage of 17 with her mother Pauline and
OL,19,Fbrother Mitchell and, looking back, she
OL,20,Fsaid remembers life at the time being
OL,21,Ffull of adventure.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
