OL,3,GNEWSAFormer residents' sad farewell as
OL,4,Aflat demolition begins
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My brother used to jump in the lift
OL,7,Ftrying to get it stuck, so we'd end up
OL,8,Ftrapped between floors," she laughed.
OL,9,F"One time the fire brigade had to lift
OL,10,Fme out halfway between floors."
